        <text>Correct. The y-intercept is 14, so the predicted value at x=0 is 14.</text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text>y=14x</text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text>When x=0, this model gives 0.</text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG2_U06_L03_Q16</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Question ID:&lt;/strong&gt; ALG2_U06_L03_Q16&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLA Standard:&lt;/strong&gt; MLA.A2.FM.1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Which model predicts a decreasing exponential relationship?&lt;/p&gt;</text>
